date: 2026-10-03
host: AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D (32 threads), Linux 7.0.0-34-generic
rustc: 1.99.0 (b940084d7 2026-09-28)
harness: zenbench 0.1.7 (interleaved groups, native API)
base commit: f209b89472 (main + package trim + semver gate); runs 1-4 measured the
  V3-delegated AVX-512 path; run 5 measured the AVX-512 vpmovusdb overrides committed
  together with this file.
command (runs 1-3, 5): ~/work/zen/scripts/run-heavy --mem 16G -- \
  cargo bench -p magetypes --bench pixel_pack --features avx512
command (run 4, layout redraw): RUSTFLAGS="--cfg pixel_pack_redraw" \
  CARGO_TARGET_DIR=~/tmp/archmage-redraw-target ~/work/zen/scripts/run-heavy --mem 20G -- \
  cargo bench -p magetypes --bench pixel_pack --features avx512
load during runs: 1.8-5.5 (1-minute average), box otherwise idle
run logs (local): ~/tmp/pixel-bench-run{1,2,3,4-redraw,5}.log
